    <sys:String x:Key="IdentityConfig.Scope">Existing identity configuration: generate and review one new VMware-format value at a time. Limited to Workstation 17.5.2 build-23775571, hardware 19, valid existing MAC/UUID and one static host-only NIC disconnected at startup. Execution requires a fully powered-off VM.</sys:String>
